                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.942/23: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kellogg</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-07-17T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 17, 1924—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>221. Your telegram No. 250, July 14, 2 p.m. You may give Foreign Office informal
                    memorandum of views as suggested.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
